From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx9: SHMultiply5/6, frame helpers, resource loaders, skin info, vertex conversions (3501)

d3dx9: SHMultiply5/6, frame helpers, cube/volume texture and volume loaders from resources, skin info, UDEC3/DEC3N conversion

D3DXSHMultiply5/6 from the triple-product integrals of the basis (checked against SHMultiply4).
D3DXFrameAppendChild / NumNamedMatrices / RegisterNamedMatrices / CalculateBoundingSphere.
D3DXCreateCubeTextureFromResource{A,W,ExA,ExW}, D3DXCreateVolumeTextureFromResource{A,W,ExA,ExW},
D3DXLoadVolumeFromResource{A,W} (the spec lines of every d3dx9_NN DLL).
ID3DXSkinInfo::UpdateSkinnedMesh (linear blend skinning of positions and normals) and Remap.
Mesh vertex conversions to and from UDEC3 / DEC3N / USHORT2N / USHORT4N.
ID3DXEffect::OnResetDevice, ID3DXRenderToSurface/EnvMap and ID3DXFont lost/reset are quiet successes.
